{"sections":[],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/spatialtrees\/kdtree"]}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SpatialTrees\/documentation\/SpatialTrees"]]},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:12SpatialTrees6KDTreeV","symbolKind":"struct","modules":[{"name":"SpatialTrees"}],"title":"KDTree","roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"KDTree","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"KDTree"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"KDTree.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/GrafluentCollections\/blob\/main\/Sources\/SpatialTrees\/KDTree.swift#L25"}},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SpatialTrees\/documentation\/SpatialTrees\/KDTree","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"A k-d tree: a fixed set of points in ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"k","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" dimensions that finds the points nearest a query, or","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"within a radius or a box of it, without testing every point.","type":"text"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SpatialTrees\/SK","doc:\/\/SpatialTrees\/Sl","doc:\/\/SpatialTrees\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/SpatialTrees\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/SpatialTrees\/SQ","doc:\/\/SpatialTrees\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/SpatialTrees\/s25ExpressibleByArrayLiteralP","doc:\/\/SpatialTrees\/Sk","doc:\/\/SpatialTrees\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/SpatialTrees\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/SpatialTrees\/ST"]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"k-d-trees","title":"k-d trees","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SpatialTrees\/documentation\/SpatialTrees\/BoundingBox"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind